      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "This bucket is blue.",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "phrase.blue.en",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "I have a blue bucket.",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "quest.iowa-home.intro.cs",
      "locale": "cs-CZ",
      "text": "Adame, dneska začíná tvoje dračí výprava! Sbalíme helmu, svačinu a atlas.",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "quest.iowa-home.intro.en",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Adam, your dragon adventure starts today! Let's pack your helmet, snack, and atlas.",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "quest.iowa-fishing.intro.cs",
      "locale": "cs-CZ",
      "text": "U jezera se něco pohnulo. Připrav si prut a podíváme se, co tam plave.",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "quest.iowa-fishing.intro.en",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Something moved in the lake. Get your fishing rod and let's see what is swimming there.",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "quest.klarka-atlas.intro.cs",
      "locale": "cs-CZ",
      "text": "Klárka přijela na návštěvu a vzala lupu. Pod tím listem se schovává malý soused!",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "quest.klarka-atlas.intro.en",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Aunt Klárka is visiting, and she brought a magnifying glass. A tiny neighbor is hiding under that leaf!",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "quest.travel.intro.cs",
      "locale": "cs-CZ",
      "text": "Atlas máme, kufřík také. Letíme za babi a dědou do Příbrami!",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "quest.travel.intro.en",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "We have our atlas and our suitcase. We are flying to see Grandma and Grandpa in Příbram!",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "quest.workshop.intro.cs",
      "locale": "cs-CZ",
      "text": "Děda už otevřel dílnu. Připravíme kolo a pak vyrazíme k rybníku.",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "quest.workshop.intro.en",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Grandpa has opened the workshop. Let's get your bicycle ready and ride to the pond.",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "quest.mystery-catch.intro.cs",
      "locale": "cs-CZ",
      "text": "Adame, Matyáši, něco tam šplouchlo! Děda říká, že ryba. Já si myslím, že moje ztracená bota!",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "quest.mystery-catch.intro.en",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Adam, Matyáš, something splashed! Grandpa says it is a fish. I think it might be my missing boot!",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "quest.big-fish.intro.cs",
      "locale": "cs-CZ",
      "text": "Dneska porovnáme malé a velké úlovky. Klárka nám je pomůže zakreslit do atlasu.",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "quest.big-fish.intro.en",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Today we will compare small and big catches. Aunt Klárka will help us add them to the atlas.",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "quest.tell-grandma.intro.cs",
      "locale": "cs-CZ",
      "text": "Babi už čeká na zahradě. Ukážeme jí atlas a povíme, co jsme chytili.",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "quest.tell-grandma.intro.en",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Grandma is waiting in the garden. Let's show her the atlas and tell her what we caught.",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ui.replay.cs",
      "locale": "cs-CZ",
      "text": "Poslechneme si to ještě jednou.",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ui.replay.en",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Let's listen one more time.",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ui.uncertain.cs",
      "locale": "cs-CZ",
      "text": "Neslyšel jsem tě dobře. Zkusíme to znovu, nebo půjdeme dál?",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ui.uncertain.en",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "I couldn't hear you clearly. Shall we try again or keep going?",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ui.verified.cs",
      "locale": "cs-CZ",
      "text": "Karta má novou hlasovou pečeť!",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ui.verified.en",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Your card has a new speaking badge!",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ui.parent.cs",
      "locale": "cs-CZ",
      "text": "Pojď ukázat někomu doma, co už dokážeš.",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ui.parent.en",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Let's show someone at home what you can do.",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ui.finish.cs",
      "locale": "cs-CZ",
      "text": "Výprava je hotová. Teď si můžeme odpočinout.",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ui.finish.en",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Our adventure is complete. Now we can take a break.",
      "speaker": "romca",
      "status": "script-only",
      "file": null
    }
  ]
}
